      "evidence": "The proof says that the “standard proof of [L2] arranges” a morphism of short exact sequences whose snake sequence is the composite sequence. But the cited current dependency thm-the-kernel-cokernel-sequence-of-a-composite states only that “there is an exact sequence,” and its proof derives exactness through applications of thm-exactness-of-kernel-and-cokernel-sequences-under-endpoint-hypotheses; it neither gives such a snake diagram nor identifies its maps with a snake sequence. Thus [L2] does not license the claimed literal identification.",
