      "evidence": "The described diagram cannot exist as stated. Its first two columns are each declared to be 0 → Z/2 → Z/4 → Z/2 → 0 and its third column zero, so the three objects in the middle row would be Z/4, Z/4, 0. The same paragraph requires that middle row to be the identity copy of 0 → Z/2 → Z/4 → Z/2 → 0, whose objects are Z/2, Z/4, Z/2. These specifications are incompatible.",
